## A suggested way to use the book

A week or two before your trip, read the first two chapters and skim the three appendices. Read the chapters for the cities and {scenic-regions/islands} you will be visiting. Take a screenshot of the phrase card and the emergency contacts on your phone. If anything in this book turns out to apply during your trip, open it again on the {transit-mode} or in your hotel room and check what to do.

You will almost certainly not need most of it. That is the point.

